    "formula": "Hand-drawn pencil and ink illustration on plain off-white paper: loose sketchy black and graphite-grey lines, soft grey pencil hatching for shading, simple cartoon people with round heads, dot eyes and thin limbs, mostly greyscale with one single accent colour, a soft warm yellow, used only for electric light, calm uncluttered wide composition with generous white space, non-photorealistic. No text, no letters, no numbers, no words, no labels, no logos, no captions anywhere in the image."
